  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 1上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:10 P.M. \\ Clear\nWolumonde, Leithanien. Once a bustling hub of commerce, this nomadic town is now rarely seen by outsiders."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Rathaus"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Schultz Severin Hawthorn, where have you been?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How are we supposed to get anything done in a strategic planning session without you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Was I here when you decided my son's fate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well... Tatjana should already have..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, she told me. You had her tell me. I'm only reminding you what you've done."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Infected are still protesting. They've even started chasing off Infected newcomers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do they want?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They... they believe the fire was part of some kind of plot. They demand an explanation for Dr. Atro and the dead Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A plot? An explanation? Great, someone must be riling them up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even the Infected wouldn't stoop that low. Most of them are from Wolumonde."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have they had any contact with that militant group out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "None, for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the militants have been lingering around the outskirts of the hamlet. I'm worried they might influence the protestors."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just a second, it's from the sentry—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Two? Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They claim to be from Rhodes Island? I know that name—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That would be Dr. Atro's company. *Sigh.* We knew this was coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh-what do we do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr. Atro was a respectable Infected. They may be here looking for her. And they have a right to know the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let them in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...You heard him. Do as he says."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm, are you sure about this? What if they have something to do with the militants out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Between the Great Rift, the fire, and the Infected, do we have the luxury to be suspicious of everyone who knocks on our door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about after they learn the truth? What if Rhodes Island seeks reparations from us? How much is Wolumonde to suffer?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...So what should we do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lock our doors and send them away? Lie to them? Tell them Dr. Atro took some Oripathy patients out on a hike?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know we can't sweep it under the rug. But you don't have the final say in this. We have to prepare for the worst."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No one has the final say on the truth, but... Never mind. Do as you will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm leaving."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Leaving? Where are you going this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I have a problem to solve."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My only job is to get this town back on track. The decision-making process? I have little patience for your political games."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey! Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know you're suffering, and there's so much we could've done better, but we had no choice!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I understand. That's why I'm still talking to you nice and peacefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll leave Rhodes Island to you. You're good at these things. I'll walk the blocks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's the deal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Severin! Severin Hawthorn! You are this town's Schultz! You can't be running all over the—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh! Must he always..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Forget it. Tatjana, Severin, Thor. They're all tragic figures, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Councilor",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's get this place cleaned up. Rhodes Island will be here soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wolumonde. Its name means 'The Eighth Moon,' and together with seven other nearby towns, it makes up Leithanien's flourishing northern trade network—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's what the book said, anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "From what I'm seeing, 'flourishing trade' isn't exactly how I'd describe it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Could it be because of the 'Great Rift' thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. A Catastrophe of that scale is rare. It could be more than a thousand meters deep, with exposed active Originium on the cliffsides. I shudder just thinking about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But, Miss Folinic... You were very curious what would happen if you lobbed a shell into it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nay, that was just my academic curiosity speaking. Realistically, one wrong move and the entire plateau could get cleaved in half."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Considering the detour we had to take, looks like this town won't be moving an inch."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Visitors at a time like this? And such strange clothes. I hope this isn't an ill omen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at her tails. Oh, and the crystals on her shoulder! Is she Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But those clothes look familiar... Where have I seen them before...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "M-Miss Folinic, can we really just walk down the street like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The prevalence of Originium Arts in Leithanien have brought two major benefits: first, the incredible music scene, and second, a broad tolerance of the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There may be restrictions on your personal freedom, but should you want to live, you can win back that right as long as you're willing to pay the price."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Price?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "At least it's something affordable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wolumonde may be in the boonies and have its fair share of problems, but at least the Infected have a place to live... That's what she told me anyway—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Oh, someone's coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Hm? That man's uniform...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Is he with the Wolumonde Gendarmerie? Should we ask for directions?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(He's coming toward us. Is this the welcoming committee?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(I'm not sure...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Oh, he lit a cigarette.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(He put his lighter into his pocket. Now he's holding the cigarette with his other hand. He switched hands again—)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(—He walked away without looking back! Miss Folinic!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello, we're—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, Rhodes Island, I take it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Rathaus is just up ahead, right in front of the tallest tower. You see it? Good. Someone will meet you there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, thanks. Can I ask your name...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Me? I'm off duty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um, what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm off duty. And I really don't want to talk so much when I'm off... I have my own business to deal with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's the deal. Later."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And he's gone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He was kind of rude, but I think he's been through a lot..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah... as if we're not tired!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But at least he told us where to go. Let's go talk to the local—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Schultz! There you are!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Infected are protesting again. The Gendarmerie are already on the scene, but they need you there leading them—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah! You're smoking! Did the shopkeepers get to you again? Please, you have an image to maintain. You wouldn't want to lose the trust of the people—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...That's a... Schultz? A 'Schultheiß' is like a local leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is something wrong, Schultz?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. You're always working so hard, Tatjana. I admire you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you? Thank you—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now, about those two, they're not from around here, are they? Could they be the doctors from Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh? Well, yes. We are indeed. I am Folinic and this is Suzuran."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Doctors?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(I think we count.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Suzuran",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Even me?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(I'm a fully-fledged operator assigned to the Medical Department. And Lisa, you've... studied with Dr. Kal'tsit, so we can call you a medical intern. I guess.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I see... Oh! You two must be on your way to the Rathaus? I'm so sorry to get in your way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course it should be the Schultz who receives you, but he really is needed at Zwölftontechnik Strasse... Er..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, really, he can—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahem! Very good, Tatjana, you take them. I'll go look into this Infected situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You two."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—Yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know why you're here. But our situation is dire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you know what happened to Wolumonde?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Great Rift."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. I get to skip over so much when dealing with smart people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So now the Infected are more riled up than ever before. If you don't want to get mixed up in that, stay away from Zwölftontechnik Strasse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We are experts at dealing with the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know. We had a Dr. Atro from your company working closely with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you know we can help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We don't need it yet. It wouldn't be right to drag our guests into this mess as soon as they've arrived. That would get us into trouble too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...So what is Atro doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's not here right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Folinic",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So where is she?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh no! Fighting has broken out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Th-those Infected have weapons! What's going on?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Townsfolk",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They've got blades! Are they going to kill us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tatjana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Schultz!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You two are Infected experts, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Severin",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
